   "id": "valid-reset-to-0v",
   "title": "Valid reset low down to VCC1 = VCC2 = 0",
   "page": 8,
   "description": "A 100 kΩ resistor from the push-pull reset output to ground keeps the reset output valid low as VCC1 and VCC2 fall to 0 V. It does not work with the open-drain parts (MAX6352, MAX6355, MAX6358).",
   "parts": [
    {
     "ref": "U1",
